    "text": "Let $\\mathrm{S}$ be the focus of the hyperbola $\\frac{x^2}{3}-\\frac{y^2}{5}=1$, on the positive $x$-axis. Let $\\mathrm{C}$ be the circle with its centre at $A(\\sqrt{6}, \\sqrt{5})$ and passing through the point $S$. If $O$ is the origin and $S A B$ is a diameter of $C$, then the square of the area of the triangle OSB is equal to___________",
